                    "fact": {"id": "tbm-school-round", "text": {"en": "In 1886 a reader of the journal Notes and Queries called Three Blind Mice \"the school round\", and wrote that in all the copies of the round he had met the words ran \"They all ran after the farmer's wife\".", "es": "En 1886, un lector de la revista Notes and Queries llamó a Three Blind Mice \"el canon de la escuela\", y escribió que en todas las copias que había visto la letra decía \"They all ran after the farmer's wife\"."}, "source": {"en": "Notes and Queries, 7th series, vol. 2 (25 December 1886), p. 507, read from the scan", "es": "Notes and Queries, 7.ª serie, vol. 2 (25 de diciembre de 1886), p. 507, leído en el escaneo"}, "url": "https://archive.org/details/sim_notes-and-queries_1886-12-25_2_52"}
